<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Pendaftaran Disetujui</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f3f4f6; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;">
  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color:#f3f4f6; padding: 20px 0;">
    <tr>
      <td align="center">
        <table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:8px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);">
          <!-- Header -->
          <tr>
            <td style="background-color:#1e3a5f; padding:24px 32px; text-align:center;">
              <h1 style="margin:0; color:#ffffff; font-size:22px; font-weight:700;">ADTC</h1>
              <p style="margin:4px 0 0; color:#93c5fd; font-size:13px;">Ahmad Dahlan Training Center</p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Body -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:32px;">
              <div style="width:48px; height:48px; background-color:#dbeafe; border-radius:50%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; margin-bottom:20px;">
                <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2563eb" stroke-width="2"><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4M7.835 4.697a3.42 3.42 0 001.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 014.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 001.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 013.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010 4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-4.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138-3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010-4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00.806-1.946A3.42 3.42 0 019 12z"/></svg>
              </div>

              <h2 style="margin:0 0 8px; color:#1e293b; font-size:20px; font-weight:700;">Pendaftaran Anda Disetujui!</h2>
              <p style="margin:0 0 24px; color:#64748b; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6;">
                Halo <%= registration.full_name %>,<br>
                pendaftaran Anda untuk program <strong><%= registration.training_title %></strong> telah disetujui oleh admin. Silakan lakukan pembayaran sesuai instruksi di bawah.
              </p>

              <!-- Info Pendaftaran -->
              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color:#f8fafc; border-radius:8px; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; margin-bottom:24px;">
                <tr>
                  <td style="padding:16px 20px; border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;">
                    <span style="color:#64748b; font-size:13px;">Nama Peserta</span><br>
                    <span style="color:#1e293b; font-size:15px; font-weight:600;"><%= registration.full_name %></span>
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td style="padding:16px 20px; border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;">
                    <span style="color:#64748b; font-size:13px;">Kode Referensi</span><br>
                    <span style="color:#1e3a5f; font-size:15px; font-weight:700; font-family:monospace; background-color:#dbeafe; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:4px;"><%= registration.reference_code %></span>
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td style="padding:16px 20px; border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;">
                    <span style="color:#64748b; font-size:13px;">Program</span><br>
                    <span style="color:#1e293b; font-size:15px; font-weight:600;"><%= registration.training_title %></span>
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td style="padding:16px 20px;">
                    <span style="color:#64748b; font-size:13px;">Jumlah Pembayaran</span><br>
                    <span style="color:#1e3a5f; font-size:18px; font-weight:700;"><%= new Intl.NumberFormat('id-ID', { style: 'currency', currency: 'IDR', minimumFractionDigits: 0 }).format(registration.final_price) %></span>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <!-- Info Bank -->
              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color:#eff6ff; border-radius:8px; border:1px solid #bfdbfe; margin-bottom:24px;">
                <tr>
                  <td style="padding:16px 20px;">
                    <p style="margin:0 0 8px; color:#1e3a5f; font-size:14px; font-weight:600;">Informasi Rekening Pembayaran</p>
                    <p style="margin:0; color:#334155; font-size:14px;"><%= bankAccount.bankName %> — <strong><%= bankAccount.accountNumber %></strong> a.n. <%= bankAccount.accountName %></p>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <p style="margin:0 0 24px; color:#475569; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6;">
                Transfer sesuai jumlah di atas, lalu unggah bukti pembayaran melalui tautan di bawah.
              </p>

              <!-- CTA Button -->
              <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin-bottom:24px;">
                <tr>
                  <td style="border-radius:6px; background-color:#2563eb; text-align:center;">
                    <a href="<%= process.env.BASE_URL %>/registrations/<%= registration.access_token %>/success" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block; padding:12px 28px; color:#ffffff; font-size:15px; font-weight:600; text-decoration:none; border-radius:6px;">Cek Status & Upload Bukti</a>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <% if (groupLink) { %>
              <!-- WhatsApp Group Link -->
              <div style="background-color:#f0fdf4; border:1px solid #86efac; border-radius:8px; padding:16px 20px; margin-bottom:24px;">
                <p style="margin:0 0 8px; color:#166534; font-size:14px; font-weight:600;">💬 Grup WhatsApp Peserta</p>
                <p style="margin:0 0 12px; color:#15803d; font-size:13px; line-height:1.5;">Setelah pembayaran Anda diverifikasi, Anda akan diundang ke grup WhatsApp peserta untuk koordinasi lebih lanjut.</p>
                <a href="<%= groupLink %>" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block; background-color:#16a34a; color:#ffffff; font-size:14px; font-weight:600; padding:10px 20px; border-radius:6px; text-decoration:none;">Bergabung ke Grup WA</a>
              </div>
              <% } %>

              <p style="margin:0; color:#94a3b8; font-size:13px; line-height:1.5;">
                Jika ada pertanyaan, silakan hubungi admin via WhatsApp.
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Footer -->
          <tr>
            <td style="background-color:#f8fafc; padding:20px 32px; text-align:center; border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;">
              <p style="margin:0; color:#94a3b8; font-size:12px;">&copy; 2026 Ahmad Dahlan Training Center. Semua hak dilindungi.</p>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>
